I lost my husband, Charles, to blood clots. Yesterday would have been our 20th wedding anniversary.

I know how serious they can be - America should know too. 

@NFL owes Eagles fans, and the American people, an explanation for the decisions that put @JalenHurts  in harm's way. https://t.co/YGSPuXSjfJ

Many of us have questions about AI safety, but we also need to know how its related infrastructure, like data centers, will impact our lives.

@SenJohnCurtis and I are teaming up to increase transparency and community involvement.

https://t.co/tIoDlLwXA0
